### 获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:8330/browser/status
Accept: application/json

### 获取单个用户
GET http://localhost:8330/browser/action
Accept: application/json

### 创建新用户
POST http://localhost:8330/init_sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{"secrets": {"test": "test"}}


### 创建文件
POST http://localhost:8330/text_editor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "view",
  "path": "test1.txt",
  "sudo": false
}

### view
POST http://localhost:8330/text_editor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "view",
  "path": "test1.txt",
  "sudo": false
}

### write
POST http://localhost:8330/text_editor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "write",
  "path": "test1.txt",
  "sudo": false,
  "append": true,
  "file_text": "hello world>>>>"
}


